  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Also given circle passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving&nbsp;equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now equation&nbsp;of circle will be,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now length of intercept on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>23</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>",
